<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for Laughing Dragons Productions and laughing-dragons.com." />
    <title>Privacy Policy</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/brand/ldp-logo.png" type="image/png" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://laughing-dragons.com/privacy/" />
</head>
  <body>
    <div id="app"></div>
    <script src="/assets/js/config.js"></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/site.js"></script>
    <script>
      initPage({
        title: "Privacy Policy",
        description: "Privacy Policy for Laughing Dragons Productions and laughing-dragons.com.",
        activePath: "/privacy/",
        content: `
          <header class="page-header reveal">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Last updated: August 9, 2026</p>
          </header>
          <div class="prose reveal">
            <p>Laughing Dragons Productions ("we", "us") operates <a href="/">laughing-dragons.com</a>. This policy explains how we handle information when you visit our website.</p>

            <h2>Information we collect</h2>
            <p>This site is mostly static HTML. We do not require an account to browse. If you use our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>, you voluntarily send your name, email address, and message through Web3Forms. We do not sell personal information.</p>

            <h2>Third-party services</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — may use cookies to serve ads. See the Advertising section below.</li>
              <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosts and delivers the site; may process IP addresses and request logs for security and performance.</li>
              <li><strong>Web3Forms</strong> — delivers contact form submissions to our inbox.</li>
              <li><strong>YouTube / Shopify / Etsy</strong> — outbound links to our channels and shops; those sites have their own policies.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Advertising</h2>
            <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites.</p>
            <p>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
            <p>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</p>
            <p>We may show Google AdSense ads on finished <a href="/games/">Games</a> pages (<code>/games/</code>) for general audiences. Each live game includes a written guide alongside the play area.</p>
            <p>We do <strong>not</strong> place advertising on the Fruit Friends <a href="/kids/">Kids Show</a> (<code>/kids/</code>) or on pages that are under development or coming soon.</p>

            <h2>Cookies</h2>
            <p>Essential cookies may be set by our hosting provider. Advertising cookies may be set by Google when ad units are active on <code>/games/</code> pages only. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

            <h2>Analytics</h2>
            <p>We may enable analytics in the future. If we do, this page will be updated with the provider and data collected.</p>

            <h2>Data retention</h2>
            <p>Contact form messages are retained in our email inbox until we delete them. Server logs retained by Cloudflare follow their standard retention policies.</p>

            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:laughingdragonsproductions@gmail.com">laughingdragonsproductions@gmail.com</a> or our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>

            <h2>Apps and other properties</h2>
            <p>Our mobile apps (DRI, Dragon Gems, Loquora) may have additional privacy practices in their store listings. This policy governs laughing-dragons.com only.</p>
          </div>
        `,
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
